# `claude plugin eval` run output: scores, prompts, judge verdicts and a
# self-contained HTML report, written per run under a timestamped directory. The
# cases and their graders are committed; a run's results are a measurement of one
# moment against a model that moves, and a committed one reads as a standing claim.
evals/results/
